  "mathematical_review": [
    {
      "group": "Kun beta sparse extension",
      "conclusion": "Current sparse-incomparability and high-girth reverse map complete the beta-family reduction, including empty template family. The distinct same-tau target is already supplied by canonical modern a78. Preserve the unique beta step as contribution and close the old followup through its effective successor."
    },
    {
      "group": "MMO to equal-two-endpoint FPTAS",
      "conclusion": "Preserve each parallel job record, tail assignment and all loads. Incidence contraction pays width; q=min(epsilon,1)W/d and upward integer rounding give per-machine error at most dq and actual (1+epsilon) schedule. Safe join includes all merged active coordinates and squared table enumeration. This is the equal-positive-time two-distinct-endpoint contribution only; no faster printed join or general eligibility assertion."
    },
    {
      "group": "Adaptive source payment and route comparison",
      "conclusion": "Hall local preflow extension and predictable owner absorption are jointly necessary ALL inputs. Same convex Gamma with owner total cancellation at least min(g_i,r_i) keeps the mean feasible. A_src<=D pays K_src<=u; if g<=r then eta>=u, otherwise all owner source is cancelled. Incoming remains unpaid. For identical Gamma/LOCAL-TOTAL/prices, every earliest path is feasible for best-natural, hence V_best<=V_adapt and the universal existence guarantee transfers conditionally in this direction."
    },
    {
      "group": "H4 and relay isolated comparisons",
      "conclusion": "For the entire positive-integer E3(a) times J2(b) zero-root family, theta=(a+b)/2 and min(d-v)=-a/2 imply every H_A=H=b/2. Only a general-H contribution. Frontshift strict 1/5 does not refute the general <= lemma; reverse parent IC fails 65/30<67/30. STATIC-2 only conditionally pays OPT<=3W. P0 existential owner/new-tree, floating 54/26 templates, static 17-label family, specified 585-customer pushforward and formal stationary negative coefficient keep their exact domains. Current clock continuous-window whole is reused by unchanged SHA."
    },
    {
      "group": "Common pivots and actual finite points",
      "conclusion": "For each r!=s, five diagonal and twenty off-diagonal fixed legal end-move comparisons separately pay D_rs and E_rs; A_rs=D_rs+E_rs alone cannot separate them. Shared T pays h_s, without cross-menu dot. Old D21 is strictly negative while old A21=0. New and old atoms/support agree but all 38 positive weights differ; new D21=0 and other eleven positive, with O-2W>0. This refutes only the 2408-row nonnegative-mass template. Harmonic potential k=1 rewrites a coefficient, not its IC sign. The exact three-premise canonical ALL is reused; no duplicate edge."
